# COO-CHARTER-02 (5): BUILD-00n that lands IS server "v n", and the version index has
# to reach whoever clones this next - a version list that lives only on one machine is
# the same failure round 87 recorded about reports.  Root is deny-by-default here, so a
# new root file needs this line or it is silently never committed.
!/SERVER_VERSIONS.md
!/reports/
/reports/*
